<h2>Asobi Review 1.0 (build 986)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>&#8984;V pastes an image into a note or a reply</b> while you are typing in it &#8212; the clipboard picture becomes an attachment. (It didn't in 976: the text field kept the paste for itself.)</li>
<li><b>The notes column is resizable</b>: drag the handle on its left edge (double-click it to reset); the width is remembered. The timecode chip no longer crops at the narrow width.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
